DESCRIPTION:Eastville Comedy Club is Brooklyn's oldest comedy clubBrooklyn 
 Free Clinic is the only comprehensive\, outpatient free clinic in Brooklyn 
 that provides ongoing primary care to uninsured adults. It has been in oper
 ation for 19 years and is run by medical\, nursing\, and public health stud
 ents at SUNY Downstate. We are funded by state and national grants\, fundra
 ising\, and private donations. We provide cancer screenings\, housing refer
 rals\, HIV/STI testing\, diabetes counseling\, PrEP enrollment\, free veget
 able bags\, referrals for substance use issues\, and much more. In 2025 alo
 ne\, the clinic served 297 patients\, filling a critical primary care gap i
 n central Brooklyn.Website link: [link removed] lineup:host - Diego MataSha
